cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset in your research or trading tools, please cite it and star the repository."
title: "XAUUSD Tick Data 2026 — Free Gold Tick-by-Tick Historical Dataset"
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: tjrgame97
repository-code: "https://github.com/tjrgame97/xauusd-tick-data-2026"
abstract: >-
  Complete tick-by-tick historical data for spot gold (XAU/USD) covering
  calendar year 2026, sourced from Dukascopy Bank SA's public data feed.
  ~79 million ticks with UTC millisecond timestamps, bid/ask prices and
  volumes, delivered as weekly gzip CSVs plus daily OHLCV aggregates.
keywords:
  - XAUUSD
  - gold
  - tick-data
  - historical-data
  - dukascopy
  - forex
  - backtesting
  - quantitative-finance
  - dataset
  - metatrader
  - pandas
license: MIT
committers:
